From 3eb0542811dce9a2c364b607f3272344c8f12d4e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: builder <builder@localhost>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 16:17:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/20] AGS-W09: forward-port to lineage-17.1 (Android 10)

- AndroidProducts.mk + lineage_ags_w09.mk; own Android 10 fingerprint
- flattened APEX, qcom sepolicy-legacy-um, system.prop for system-side props
- boot ramdisk: first-stage fstab (system, vendor), the 15.1 ramdisk init.qcom.rc
  (+ restricted cpuset), ueventd.qcom.rc and WiFi bring-up scripts
- /product = /system/product with the agassi ACDB (recording boost applied)
- drop the vendor-only rc files, SDCLANG and the device/qcom/common dependency
